  {
    "hotel_id": "2402582",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hotel-majapahit-surabaya_2/hotel/surabaya-id.html",
    "name": "Hotel Majapahit Surabaya MGallery",
    "detail": "Surabaya was originally the transit city for our Mount Bromo trip, but the brief overnight stay turned out to be a delightful surprise, making one want to slow down and experience the history. The service team was professional and considerate; the friendly glasses-wearing staff at the front desk went above and beyond to decorate our room for a honeymoon, even giving us a small cake. The attention to detail was very heartwarming. The ancient buildings were well preserved, and the atmosphere of the corridor rooms was strong, giving off a vintage feel. Breakfast was served until 10 AM with a rich variety of options; the coffee was delicious, and the staff proactively brought it to our seats. The curry beef soup is highly recommended. The location is excellent, just a 10-minute walk to TP Mall, and the lively street across from the hotel is bustling with cafes, restaurants, and small shops. At night, locals line up for photo booths, allowing you to truly experience the local vibrancy of Surabaya.",
